<title>USA: Banner Aerospace in talks for acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Banner Aerospace in talks for acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banner Aerospace said Friday it was positioned to actively pursue acquisitions that are currently in the advanced stages of negotiation.</p>
<p>It also said further substantial increases in sales for the current fiscal year are being stimulated by the increased build rate of new aircraft.</p>
</text>
